OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Rameau
OL,6,     F1/5. Donald Macleod traces
OL,7,     FRameau's early years, including
OL,8,     Fhis search for the right job and a
OL,9,     Ftrip to Italy, although the
OL,10,     Fcomposer's early years remain
OL,11,     Flargely a mystery.
OL,12,G1700 In Tune
OL,13,     FPetroc introduces live music from
OL,14,     Fpianist Mariam Batsashvili. Petroc
OL,15,     Falso chats to Christopher White
OL,16,     Fabout the legacy of Dame Felicity
OL,17,     FLott.
OL,18,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,19,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,20,     Fsoundscape of classical music.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG2/4
