OL,5,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FViolinist Mari Samuelsen joins the
OL,7,     FScottish Chamber Orchestra and
OL,8,     Fconductor David Brophy for works
OL,9,     Fby Philip Glass, John Adams and
OL,10,     FMax Richter.
OL,11,G2145 An Actor's Life: Ralph Fiennes
OL,12,     FThe first of a five-part
OL,13,     Fconversation between Neil Dudgeon
OL,14,     Fand Ralph Fiennes, where Fiennes
OL,15,     Fdescribes his background and
OL,16,     Ftraining as an actor.
OL,17,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,18,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,19,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Feverything in between.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG3/4
